Package: sylvester
Type: Package
Title: Solve Sylvester Matrix Equations via RcppArmadillo
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("cyg", "cyg", email = "cyg5005@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Solves the Sylvester matrix equation A X + X B = Q for real or
    complex matrices, mirroring scipy.linalg.solve_sylvester. The real case
    dispatches to Armadillo's LAPACK-backed solver (the same dtrsyl routine
    scipy uses); the complex case uses a Bartels-Stewart implementation
    (Schur decomposition plus triangular back-substitution).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports: Rcpp
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), reticulate
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
